# Lantern Ledger
A fictional community ledger. This folder is a source snapshot, not necessarily a complete checkout. Current screens show records and searchable notes.
export function filterTitles(rows: Array<{ title: string }>, value: string) {
  const text = value.toLowerCase().trim();
  return rows.filter(row => row.title.toLowerCase().includes(text));
}
This laptop backup contains a subset of project experiments and screenshots, not a verified complete repository history. Some meeting notes were never included.
